### List comedy shows
GET http://localhost:5000/api/comedy?page=1&limit=10

### Search comedy shows
GET http://localhost:5000/api/comedy?q=Monsoon

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/comedy/comedy-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/comedy
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Last Ticket Comedy Show",
  "comedian": "Neha S",
  "venue": "Indoor Stadium",
  "date": "2026-12-08",
  "price": 249
}
